WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:34.541
<b>Lord Krishna described the glory </b>
<b>of divine spiritual knowledge,</b>

2
00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:36.458
<b>explained the importance of the guru,</b>

3
00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:42.416
<b>and also stated that to obtain this knowledge, </b>
<b>one must practice continuously,</b>

4
00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:43.500
<b>and then,</b>

5
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:49.166
<b>over time, this knowledge will automatically </b>
<b>be revealed from within.</b>

6
00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:53.958
<b>Now, in this verse, Lord Krishna </b>
<b>is describing the qualities</b>

7
00:00:53.958 --> 00:00:58.791
<b>that are essential for a true disciple </b>
<b>of spiritual knowledge.</b>

8
00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:05.541
<b>Lord Krishna says</b>

9
00:01:05.541 --> 00:01:07.583
<b>that one whose faith is firm</b>

10
00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:11.833
<b>and who has gained control </b>
<b>over their mind and senses</b>

11
00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:15.416
<b>is capable of attaining this divine knowledge.</b>

12
00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:22.875
<b>And with this divine knowledge, they will quickly</b>
<b>attain such supreme peace that never ends.</b>

13
00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:27.291
<b>Four main points are mentioned here.</b>
<b>Let’s understand them.</b>

14
00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:28.583
<b>First -</b>

15
00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:30.791
<b>the foundation of faith:</b>

16
00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:35.083
<b>This path is the path of life transformation </b>
<b>and complete peace,</b>

17
00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:40.500
<b>so it is natural that on this path, many </b>
<b>such things, many such principles will come, </b>

18
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:44.833
<b>which may seem unbelievable</b>
<b>to the material mindset.</b>

19
00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:51.666
<b>For this reason, it is extremely important to </b>
<b>have firm faith in one's guru and scriptures.</b>

20
00:01:51.666 --> 00:01:53.125
<b>But remember,</b>

21
00:01:53.125 --> 00:01:56.666
<b>this faith is never blind belief,</b>

22
00:01:56.666 --> 00:02:00.166
<b>but rather based on understanding </b>
<b>and experience.</b>

23
00:02:00.166 --> 00:02:02.541
<b>This point was mentioned earlier as well,</b>

24
00:02:02.541 --> 00:02:07.083
<b>that it is necessary for a good disciple </b>
<b>to ask appropriate questions</b>

25
00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:09.958
<b>and remove all doubts from their mind.</b>

26
00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:13.166
<b>This will make faith even stronger.</b>

27
00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:15.125
<b>The second important point is -</b>

28
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:16.541
<b>surrender:</b>

29
00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:22.000
<b>Along with faith, surrender to </b>
<b>practice is equally important.</b>

30
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.458
<b>It is not only necessary to believe </b>
<b>in Nishkam Karma Yoga,</b>

31
00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:29.750
<b>but it is necessary to practice </b>
<b>it in every aspect of life.</b>

32
00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:34.291
<b>Continuous practice alone purifies </b>
<b>the mind of a disciple.</b>

33
00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:36.125
<b>The third important point -</b>

34
00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:38.708
<b>control over the senses:</b>

35
00:02:38.708 --> 00:02:44.000
<b>Lord Krishna is emphasizing that control </b>
<b>over the senses is essential.</b>

36
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:49.375
<b>As long as there is no control over the senses, </b>
<b>the mind will remain distracted,</b>

37
00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:53.541
<b>and the path of attaining knowledge </b>
<b>will become extremely difficult.</b>

38
00:02:53.541 --> 00:02:58.166
<b>Only one who can control the </b>
<b>senses will be able to concentrate</b>

39
00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:02.375
<b>and then practice continuously with faith.</b>

40
00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:05.000
<b>The fourth important point -</b>

41
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.791
<b>quickly attaining peace:</b>

42
00:03:07.791 --> 00:03:13.625
<b>This stage will come when that disciple </b>
<b>proves true to the first three qualities.</b>

43
00:03:13.625 --> 00:03:16.541
<b>One who practices with complete faith</b>

44
00:03:16.541 --> 00:03:19.083
<b>and keeps their senses under control</b>

45
00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:23.000
<b>will not experience any delay in </b>
<b>experiencing spiritual peace.</b>

46
00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:26.250
<b>And this peace is not ordinary or momentary.</b>

47
00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:33.375
<b>It is the permanent and supreme peace that </b>
<b>liberates from the bondage of birth and death.</b>

48
00:03:33.375 --> 00:03:35.333
<b>It is necessary to remember</b>

49
00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:43.208
<b>that here, establishing faith, controlling the </b>
<b>senses, and continuous practice may take time,</b>

50
00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:50.416
<b>but once these three are achieved, spiritual</b>
<b>peace will be attained quickly.</b>

51
00:03:55.208 --> 00:03:57.416
<b>Here,</b>

52
00:03:57.416 --> 00:04:01.416
<b>there is talk of firm faith in the guru.</b>

53
00:04:01.416 --> 00:04:08.416
<b>So does one have to blindly believe in the guru?</b>

54
00:04:08.416 --> 00:04:09.916
<b>No.</b>

55
00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:15.500
<b>Faith never means blind belief.</b>

56
00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.458
<b>For this, it is necessary to </b>
<b>remember these two things.</b>

57
00:04:19.458 --> 00:04:20.791
<b>First,</b>

58
00:04:20.791 --> 00:04:23.166
<b>one will have to choose the right guru,</b>

59
00:04:23.166 --> 00:04:25.041
<b>and then second,</b>

60
00:04:25.041 --> 00:04:32.250
<b>ask appropriate questions so that </b>
<b>doubts of the mind can be dispelled.</b>

61
00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.958
<b>Nowadays,</b>

62
00:04:33.958 --> 00:04:37.416
<b>all around us, there is glitz everywhere;</b>

63
00:04:37.416 --> 00:04:41.625
<b>many types of advertisements </b>
<b>and claims are made.</b>

64
00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:45.916
<b>The same has started happening in </b>
<b>the field of knowledge as well. </b>

65
00:04:45.916 --> 00:04:53.208
<b>In such a situation, it becomes necessary </b>
<b>that when choosing one's spiritual guru,</b>

66
00:04:53.208 --> 00:05:00.583
<b>the basis should not be their fame, their </b>
<b>advertisements, and their popularity.</b>

67
00:05:00.583 --> 00:05:02.625
<b>These things are not bad,</b>

68
00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:08.750
<b>but they cannot be made </b>
<b>the basis for choosing a guru.</b>

69
00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:16.375
<b>It is necessary to understand that if you </b>
<b>want to learn with surrender,</b>

70
00:05:16.375 --> 00:05:23.583
<b>will that guru also be able to teach with </b>
<b>equal dedication by giving their time?</b>

71
00:05:23.583 --> 00:05:25.708
<b>Has any of your loved ones</b>

72
00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:31.000
<b>experienced a life transformation by </b>
<b>learning from that guru themselves?</b>

73
00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.375
<b>Choosing a guru is an important decision,</b>

74
00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:37.666
<b>so keep all these things in mind.</b>

75
00:05:37.666 --> 00:05:43.000
<b>Don't get swayed by fame, </b>
<b>advertisements, and popularity.</b>

76
00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:50.750
<b>And this thinking applies not only to </b>
<b>spirituality but to other subjects in life as well.</b>

77
00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:57.833
<b>Such as learning capital investment </b>
<b>from an economics guru,</b>

78
00:05:57.833 --> 00:06:05.000
<b>learning from a leadership expert for </b>
<b>progress in the business field, etc.</b>

79
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:08.833
<b>The guru need not be popular.</b>

80
00:06:08.833 --> 00:06:13.625
<b>It is important that the guru is good.</b>

81
00:06:18.375 --> 00:06:25.208
<b>Faith has an important role</b>
<b>in spiritual knowledge.</b>

82
00:06:25.208 --> 00:06:32.541
<b>But looking at it only from the perspective</b>
<b>of religion and beliefs would be incomplete.</b>

83
00:06:32.541 --> 00:06:33.708
<b>Because</b>

84
00:06:33.708 --> 00:06:40.583
<b>along with faith, the practice of this </b>
<b>knowledge is equally important.</b>

85
00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:47.833
<b>And for this, perhaps no situation can </b>
<b>be more suitable than the family environment.</b>

86
00:06:47.833 --> 00:06:55.958
<b>When we fulfill our responsibilities in </b>
<b>the family from a spiritual perspective,</b>

87
00:06:55.958 --> 00:06:58.916
<b>relationships also become sweet,</b>

88
00:06:58.916 --> 00:07:05.125
<b>and this serves as guidance </b>
<b>for other family members.</b>

89
00:07:05.125 --> 00:07:12.333
<b>Due to this spirituality, there will certainly</b>
<b>be changes in their behavior as well;</b>

90
00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:14.958
<b>they will discuss peacefully,</b>

91
00:07:14.958 --> 00:07:21.625
<b>focus on improvement instead of </b>
<b>scolding when a mistake happens,</b>

92
00:07:21.625 --> 00:07:28.041
<b>and will appreciate the efforts of children </b>
<b>more than their exam results.</b>

93
00:07:28.041 --> 00:07:34.791
<b>All these things are proofs that </b>
<b>sweetness comes from spirituality.</b>

94
00:07:34.791 --> 00:07:43.000
<b>And this very thing will inspire the offspring and </b>
<b>other family members towards spirituality as well.</b>

95
00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:52.250
<b>Also, it is a confirmation that spirituality </b>
<b>does not mean abandoning responsibility,</b>

96
00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:59.375
<b>but rather fulfilling every responsibility </b>
<b>from the perspective of spirituality.</b>

97
00:08:04.125 --> 00:08:06.000
<b>Faith,</b>

98
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.375
<b>dedication and surrender,</b>

99
00:08:08.375 --> 00:08:19.750
<b>control of the senses, and as a result </b>
<b>of all these, quickly attaining peace.</b>

100
00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:23.875
<b>All these principles are mentioned in this verse.</b>

101
00:08:23.875 --> 00:08:30.458
<b>And all these principles are applicable in </b>
<b>the professional setting as well.</b>

102
00:08:30.458 --> 00:08:31.708
<b>First -</b>

103
00:08:31.708 --> 00:08:33.541
<b>faith –</b>

104
00:08:33.541 --> 00:08:42.416
<b>if you have faith in the goals of the organization, </b>
<b>your work will automatically improve.</b>

105
00:08:42.416 --> 00:08:48.041
<b>For this, it is necessary that you understand </b>
<b>the goals of the organization in depth</b>

106
00:08:48.041 --> 00:08:57.791
<b>and know how you are directly or indirectly </b>
<b>helping numerous people.</b>

107
00:08:57.791 --> 00:09:03.458
<b>The feeling of helping others will </b>
<b>automatically increase faith as well.</b>

108
00:09:03.458 --> 00:09:11.583
<b>And this very faith will also inspire you </b>
<b>to ask appropriate questions</b>

109
00:09:11.583 --> 00:09:15.208
<b>and bring about appropriate changes in </b>
<b>order to achieve the goals of the organization.</b>

110
00:09:15.208 --> 00:09:16.833
<b>The second principle -</b>

111
00:09:16.833 --> 00:09:18.333
<b>dedication</b>

112
00:09:18.333 --> 00:09:20.875
<b>and surrender –</b>

113
00:09:20.875 --> 00:09:27.625
<b>in the professional setting, your surrender </b>
<b>will be towards your responsibilities.</b>

114
00:09:27.625 --> 00:09:32.125
<b>And dedication will be towards ethics.</b>

115
00:09:32.125 --> 00:09:38.125
<b>This means that you will work</b>
<b>with complete dedication,</b>

116
00:09:38.125 --> 00:09:39.791
<b>but</b>

117
00:09:39.791 --> 00:09:43.750
<b>only while walking on the path of ethics.</b>

118
00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:50.750
<b>You will strive for lasting results by staying </b>
<b>away from the craving for momentary gains.</b>

119
00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:57.333
<b>And this very thing will also be proof </b>
<b>of your credibility to others.</b>

120
00:09:57.333 --> 00:10:00.125
<b>The third principle -</b>

121
00:10:00.125 --> 00:10:03.458
<b>control over the senses –</b>

122
00:10:03.458 --> 00:10:08.291
<b>this control will prevent you from getting</b>
<b>distracted by unnecessary things</b>

123
00:10:08.291 --> 00:10:11.583
<b>and increase your concentration.</b>

124
00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:19.791
<b>At the same time, in today's modern era, men </b>
<b>and women work shoulder to shoulder.</b>

125
00:10:19.791 --> 00:10:24.416
<b>In such a situation, having physical </b>
<b>attractions in the middle of work</b>

126
00:10:24.416 --> 00:10:31.833
<b>is not only completely inappropriate but can </b>
<b>also prove to be a very big mistake.</b>

127
00:10:31.833 --> 00:10:36.875
<b>Control over one's senses and </b>
<b>attractions is necessary.</b>

128
00:10:36.875 --> 00:10:38.916
<b>And the fourth principle -</b>

129
00:10:38.916 --> 00:10:42.125
<b>attaining peace.</b>

130
00:10:42.125 --> 00:10:46.666
<b>When you have true faith in</b>
<b>the goals of the organization,</b>

131
00:10:46.666 --> 00:10:51.083
<b>fulfill your responsibilities with </b>
<b>dedication and surrender,</b>

132
00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:55.541
<b>stay focused by staying away</b>
<b>from unnecessary things,</b>

133
00:10:55.541 --> 00:11:02.958
<b>then as a result of all these, you will also </b>
<b>attain satisfaction in your work.</b>

134
00:11:02.958 --> 00:11:04.375
<b>And yes,</b>

135
00:11:04.375 --> 00:11:07.375
<b>satisfaction and peace will certainly be attained,</b>

136
00:11:07.375 --> 00:11:08.416
<b>but</b>

137
00:11:08.416 --> 00:11:12.958
<b>professional progress will also definitely happen.</b>

138
00:11:12.958 --> 00:11:15.375
<b>Reflect upon this.</b>

